\f1\b \cf0 \
Notes on the statistical agencies file\
\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl288\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\f2\b0 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Scope: The list covers the 13 principal federal statistical agencies recognized by the U.S. Office of Management and Budget plus other major federal statistical programs that regularly publish statistics.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Verified URLs are .gov domains where available.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Media contact names change frequently and many agencies do not publish a single named contact. NA means Not Available / no single named media contact published. Use the agency press office email/phone instead.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Lag times are standardized schedules, not guarantees. Shutdowns, revisions, and data quality reviews can shift dates.\
